{"message":"Because you suspect the Evergreen card may have been skimmed, the safest option is to permanently close it and order a replacement with a new card number. This will block new purchases on the current card, but any pending transactions may still process, and recurring payments will need to be updated.

You can also leave it active while monitoring, but that provides less protection if the card details were compromised. I recommend changing your online-banking password as well.

Would you like me to permanently close the Evergreen card ending in 9251 for suspected fraud and help order a replacement?"}
